### Wakes anvil-full-scan@.service weekly (plan node daemon).
###
### Persistent=true runs a scan the machine slept through; RandomizedDelaySec
### spreads many repositories' scans over six hours. The cadence is this file;
### an installation that wants another one overrides OnCalendar with a drop-in
### (`systemctl edit anvil-full-scan@.timer`). Anvil itself never parses a
### calendar expression.

[Unit]
Description=Weekly Anvil full scan of %I

[Timer]
OnCalendar=weekly
RandomizedDelaySec=6h
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
